      "seq": 556,
      "message": "TURN 16 for Gem3F Sarge (3 - 24)",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:42:09.286283-08:00",
      "seq": 557,
      "message": "Gem3F Sarge draws a card",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:42:28.155799-08:00",
      "seq": 559,
      "message": "LISTEN UP MAGGOTS! My lands are as dry as a canteen in a desert, and my recruits are dropping like flies! Stoneforge Mystic? KIA! Another one for the scrap heap! I&#39;m at 3 HP, which is exactly 3 more than you deserve! You call this a battlefield? I&#39;ve seen better discipline in a goblin war-room! PHELIA! RIDDLER! ALL GONE! If that Germ token doesn&#39;t start earning its keep, I&#39;ll melt it down for boot polish! MOVE IT!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Gem3F Sarge",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:42:40.454457-08:00",
      "seq": 561,
      "message": "Gem3F Sarge attacks Gem25F ESPN with 1 creature",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:43:50.861485-08:00",
      "seq": 563,
      "message": "Brain freeze! Auto-passing until next turn...",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Gem25F ESPN",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:43:50.861581-08:00",
      "seq": 564,
      "message": "Attacker: Phyrexian Germ Token (4/4) unblocked",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:43:54.869906-08:00",
      "seq": 565,
      "message": "ABOUT TIME SOMETHING MOVED! That Germ token is finally doing its job! Lifelink is the only thing keeping us from the dirt! If it misses, it&#39;s cleaning the latrines for a MONTH! And as for you, ESPN, keep freezing! Gives me time to yell at my boots! MAGGOTS, FORWARD!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Gem3F Sarge",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:43:56.013031-08:00",
      "seq": 566,
      "message": "Gem25F ESPN loses 4 life at combat from Phyrexian Germ Token",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:44:19.806853-08:00",
      "seq": 569,
      "message": "KARAKAS! WASTELAND! YOU TWO ARE THE LAZIEST EXCUSES FOR TERRAIN I&#39;VE EVER SEEN! Where&#39;s my BLUE mana? Did it desert? Did it go AWOL? I&#39;ve got a hand full of brilliant tactical maneuvers and no way to signal the troops! Dismissed! Get out of my sight! Pass!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Gem3F Sarge",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-11T19:44:22.004143-08:00",
      "seq": 570,
      "message": "TURN 17 for Gem25F ESPN (7 - 20)",
