      "reasoning": "\"A JAW-DROPPING REVELATION, FOLKS! My champion is faced with a tactical conundrum! The two 'Amped Raptors,' the very essence of our turn's aggression, are currently NOT AVAILABLE to declare as attackers! It's a shocking turn of events, a momentary hiccup in our otherwise flawless strategy! The 'Spirit Token' and 'Voice of Victory' are present, yes, but for my champion, this is not an attack worthy of the arena crowd!\n\
