My champion, a master of long-term strategy, recognizes that a partial, unoptimized attack now would be foolish! We need our Raptors in the fray! This means we must, with a heavy heart but clear tactical vision, DECLINE to attack this combat phase! It's difficult, folks, but sometimes the greatest plays are the ones NOT made! We cede the attack phase for now, to come back stronger, with our full force next turn! The crowd murmurs, understanding the strategic depth at play!\n\
