      "decision_index": 53,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Attacking with Ocelot Pride into an untapped Stoneforge Mystic risks losing the most important engine creature. Stoneforge (1/2) can block Ocelot Pride (1/1 first strike) - Ocelot deals 1 first strike damage but Stoneforge survives at 1 toughness, then deals 1 back killing Ocelot. The opponent would likely prefer trading their already-used Stoneforge for the token-generating engine.",
