      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "decision_index": 172,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Blocked an Amped Raptor (2/1) with Stoneforge Mystic (1/2), trading away the Stoneforge. Stoneforge Mystic is extremely valuable here as it can cheat Meteor Sword or Pre-War Formalwear into play from hand. Meanwhile, the Warrior Tokens from Mobilize will be sacrificed at the next end step anyway, so blocking one of them would save 1 damage while keeping Stoneforge alive.",
      "action_taken": "Blocked Amped Raptor (2/1) with Stoneforge Mystic, trading both away.",
      "better_line": "Block a 1/1 Warrior Token (which dies at end of step anyway) to save 1 damage while preserving Stoneforge Mystic to activate its ability next turn to put Meteor Sword or Pre-War Formalwear directly onto the battlefield.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 113,
      "player": "Gem3F Sarge",
      "decision_index": 172,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Pre-War Formalwear could resurrect Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd from the graveyard, creating an incredibly powerful recurring engine with Karakas (bounce Phelia, replay to exile opponent's permanents repeatedly). This would provide sustained removal and board advantage rather than a one-time destroy effect.",
      "action_taken": "Put Meteor Sword onto the battlefield with Stoneforge Mystic, destroying one permanent and giving +3/+3.",
      "better_line": "Put Pre-War Formalwear onto the battlefield to resurrect Phelia from the graveyard. With Karakas already in play, this creates a repeatable exile engine that can systematically dismantle the opponent's board while providing a body and +2/+2 with vigilance.",
      "type": "blunder",
      "snapshot_index": 120,
