      "decision_index": 187,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Kinscaer Sentry before Guide of Souls, missing the Guide of Souls trigger from Kinscaer Sentry entering the battlefield. Guide of Souls says 'Whenever another creature you control enters, you gain 1 life and get {E}.' By casting Guide of Souls first (W), then Kinscaer Sentry (1W), ESPN would have gained 1 life and 1 energy from the Sentry entering. The life gain also synergizes with any end-step token creation.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Kinscaer Sentry first with 3 available mana",
