      "description": "At 1 life with all opponent's creatures tapped, Sarge passed priority instead of using Stoneforge Mystic's activated ability to put Pre-War Formalwear onto the battlefield, which would reanimate Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd (MV 2) from the graveyard with +2/+2 and vigilance. This extra blocker/attacker is critical for survival at 1 life. Additionally, Wasteland could have been used to destroy an opponent's nonbasic land.",
