    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 1 life against an opponent with all creatures tapped, failed to attack with Stoneforge Mystic for an additional 1 damage. Every point of damage matters when racing from such a low life total against a token-generating deck. There was zero risk since all opponent's creatures were tapped.",
