      "description": "Targeted Stoneforge Mystic with Swords to Plowshares instead of the 4/4 Phyrexian Germ Token carrying Batterskull. The Stoneforge's value is diminished since the key Equipment (Batterskull, Cryptic Coat, Meteor Sword) are already on the battlefield. The 4/4 lifelink vigilance Germ Token is the primary threat - it blocks profitably and gains life to stabilize the opponent at 5hp.",
