    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing a second Karakas when one is already on the battlefield triggers the legend rule, forcing one to be sacrificed. This wastes the land drop entirely. Additionally, even if playing it, ESPN should cast Guide of Souls first (using the untapped Karakas for {W}) before potentially playing the duplicate Karakas, to ensure mana is available for the spell.",
