    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "At 6 life facing multiple attackers (likely Voice of Victory 1/3, Spirit Token 1/1, Amped Raptor 2/1, and two 1/1 Warrior tokens from Mobilize), not blocking with Stoneforge Mystic leaves unnecessary damage through. Every point of life matters at 6 life.",
