      "description": "Cast Sand Scout before activating Staff of the Storyteller to draw a card and before playing Flooded Strand. With 4 lands available, ESPN could activate Staff (W, tap) to draw a card first, then play Flooded Strand, then decide whether Sand Scout is still the best play. Drawing before committing resources is standard sequencing to maximize information.",
